; the settings in ENVARC:amiga-pi are yours and stay
Delete >NIL: C:amiga-pi QUIET
; the quick-launch icon in UP-Term: (only when there is an UP-Term: to look in)
Assign >NIL: UP-Term: EXISTS
If NOT WARN
  Delete >NIL: UP-Term:amiga-pi UP-Term:amiga-pi.info QUIET
EndIf
; the four skills this archive installed, each drawer by name; any other drawer in skills is the user's and stays
Delete >NIL: ENVARC:amiga-pi/skills/amigados ENVARC:amiga-pi/skills/arexx ENVARC:amiga-pi/skills/amiga-c-build ENVARC:amiga-pi/skills/amiga-autodocs ALL QUIET
Assign >NIL: UP-Term: EXISTS
If NOT WARN
  Delete >NIL: UP-Term:var/amiga-pi/skills/amigados UP-Term:var/amiga-pi/skills/arexx UP-Term:var/amiga-pi/skills/amiga-c-build UP-Term:var/amiga-pi/skills/amiga-autodocs ALL QUIET
EndIf
